if {VeilJoined} == false:
	arielsim: Nice, to see you, keep!
	simshopkeep: Nice to see you as well, Aerie. I have something important to tell you.
	arielsim: And what might that be?
	simshopkeep: I have met someone with abilities quite like yours.
	satosim: They have an Guardian? Soul Accelerators and all?
	simshopkeep: That is indeed what she called them.
	arielsim: Well, we definitely need more help to fight off the Sinners? Any chance she's willing to help?
	simshopkeep: She may be. Let me get her for you.
	victoriasim: Ummm.... hello? My name is... Veil?
	arielsim: Aerie. Nice to meet you, Veil. Care to join our party?
	victoriasim: Sure.... just to make sure the system's working...
	arielsim: System?
	satosim: She's talking about the game's dialogue system. She chose to join so quickly because the dev demanded it to make sure her code's working.
	arielsim: The hell are you on about?
	satosim: ...
	satosim: Fourth wall breaking aside, I'm glad you're willing to join us, Veil.
	victoriasim: Thank you...
	Veil has joined your party!
	[signal arg="SimVictoriaJoins"]
	set {VeilJoined} = true
else:
	simshopkeep: I wish the five of you the best of luck.